---

<BaseLayout title="Programación | XIII Coloquio Internacional en Lenguaje y Cultura" description="Programación interactiva del XIII Coloquio Internacional en Lenguaje y Cultura, 21 al 23 de octubre de 2026 en Tunja.">
  <Header />
  <main id="inicio" class="schedule-page">
    <section class="schedule-hero">
      <div class="container schedule-hero-inner">
        <p class="schedule-kicker">21–23 de octubre de 2026 · Tunja, Colombia</p>
        <h1>Programación <em>interactiva</em></h1>
        <p>Explora cada actividad y despliega las ponencias, participantes y datos de cada espacio. Los descansos se omiten para mantener una navegación clara.</p>
        <nav class="day-nav" aria-label="Ir a la programación de cada día">
          {days.map(day => <a href={`#${day.id}`}>{day.short}</a>)}
          <a href="#exposicion-fotografica">Exposición</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container schedule-content">
      {days.map(day => (
        <section id={day.id} class="schedule-day">
          <header class="day-heading"><span>Programa</span><h2>{day.date}</h2></header>
          <div class="event-grid">
            {day.events.map(event => (
              <article id={event.id} class:list={['event-card', event.talks?.length && 'has-talks']}>
                <div class="event-meta"><time>{event.time}</time><span>{event.room}</span></div>
                <p class="event-kind">{event.kind}</p>
                <h3>{event.title}</h3>
                {(event.people || event.duration) && <p class="event-people">{event.people}{event.people && event.duration ? ' · ' : ''}{event.duration}</p>}
                {event.note && <p class="event-note">{event.note}</p>}
                {event.talks && (
                  <details>
                    <summary>Ver {event.talks.length} ponencias</summary>
                    <ol>{event.talks.map(talk => <li><strong>{talk.title}</strong><span>{talk.people}</span></li>)}</ol>
                  </details>
                )}
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>
      ))}

      <section id="exposicion-fotografica" class="exhibition-card">
        <p class="event-kind">Actividad permanente · 21 al 23 de octubre · 8:00–18:00</p>
        <h2>Los petroglifos del río Caquetá y la Fuente de la Madre Serpiente</h2>
        <p>Exposición fotográfica del Maestro Fernando Urbina Rangel.</p>
        <p><strong>Lugar:</strong> Museo Arqueológico de Tunja, Edificio Central de la UPTC, primer piso.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="schedule-note">La programación puede incorporar un recorrido por el campus universitario y otro por el centro histórico de Tunja. Los auditorios de las actividades culturales de cierre están por definir.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .schedule-page{background:#f4e7cf;color:#173c31;min-height:100vh;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(244,231,207,.94),rgba(244,231,207,.94)),url('/images/fondo-secciones.png');background-size:cover;background-attachment:fixed}
  .schedule-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) 0 4.5rem;background:#213f38;color:#fff}
  .schedule-hero:before{content:"XIII";position:absolute;right:-.04em;top:-.28em;font:700 clamp(14rem,33vw,34rem)/1 'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:rgba(238,203,136,.08)}
  .schedule-hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%,rgba(211,147,28,.24),transparent 34%),repeating-linear-gradient(118deg,transparent 0 18px,rgba(255,255,255,.018) 18px 19px);pointer-events:none}
  .schedule-hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1}
  .schedule-kicker,.event-kind{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eaca8e}
  .schedule-hero h1{max-width:900px;margin:.5rem 0 1rem;font:700 clamp(3.4rem,8vw,7.5rem)/.86 'Cormorant Garamond',serif;letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .schedule-hero h1 em{color:#eaca8e;font-weight:500}
  .schedule-hero>div>p:not(.schedule-kicker){max-width:720px;color:#f6eddf;font-size:1.08rem}
  .day-nav{display:flex;gap:.65rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2rem}
  .day-nav a{padding:.65rem 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.42);border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:.88rem;transition:.2s ease}
  .day-nav a:hover{background:#eaca8e;color:#173c31;border-color:#eaca8e}
  .schedule-content{padding:4.5rem 0 6rem}
  .schedule-day{scroll-margin-top:100px;margin-bottom:5rem}
  .day-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:1rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #173c31;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
  .day-heading span{padding:.36rem .7rem;background:#892412;color:#fff;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.09em}
  .day-heading h2{margin:0;font:700 clamp(2rem,4vw,3.4rem)/1 'Cormorant Garamond',serif}
  .event-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}
  .event-card{position:relative;scroll-margin-top:105px;background:rgba(255,251,242,.92);border:1px solid rgba(23,60,49,.18);border-top:5px solid #a8442d;padding:1.35rem 1.4rem 1.45rem;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(64,43,25,.07)}
  .event-card:target{outline:4px solid rgba(211,147,28,.45);animation:targetPulse 1.2s ease}
  .event-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;color:#655b4c;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:700}
  .event-meta time{color:#892412;font-size:1rem}
  .event-kind{margin:1.1rem 0 .35rem;color:#8c6a43}
  .event-card h3{font:700 clamp(1.45rem,2.5vw,2rem)/1.05 'Cormorant Garamond',serif;margin:.2rem 0 .65rem;color:#173c31}
  .event-people,.event-note{margin:.35rem 0;color:#5f5143}
  .event-note{font-style:italic}
  details{margin-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(23,60,49,.15);padding-top:.75rem}
  summary{cursor:pointer;color:#892412;font-weight:800;list-style:none}
  summary:after{content:'＋';float:right}
  details[open] summary:after{content:'−'}
  details ol{padding-left:1.2rem;margin:1rem 0 0}
  details li{padding:.75rem .2rem;border-top:1px dotted rgba(23,60,49,.2)}
  details li span{display:block;color:#655b4c;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.2rem}
  .exhibition-card{scroll-margin-top:105px;margin-top:2rem;padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);background:#892412;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
